{"id":403703202,"chapter_id":70046,"scene_id":74611,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"深色的碎屑全部涌入弗洛尔，逐渐在空中形成实体——巨大的灰烬使徒已经上钩，它瞄准了面前的这盘“美餐”。","style":3,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"细碎的低语","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>伊帕希娅……伊帕希娅……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_403703202_01"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37032","style":1,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"细碎的低语","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>来吧，留下来，和我们融为一体……再也不离开……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_403703202_02"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37032","style":1,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"伊帕希娅","content":"……当然，留下来喂你的，有我一个就够了。","voice":["vo_event_403703202_03"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37032","style":1,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"伊帕希娅身上已经遍布伤痕。结晶的狂厄开始向上反噬，爬上肩胛——金属中间的晶石剧烈地震颤着，仿佛下一秒就要破碎。","style":3,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"她催动秘金试图引出更强的力量，但负荷过载，手臂上的金属突然炸裂开。","style":3,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"伊帕希娅","content":"？！咳、咳咳……","voice":["vo_event_403703202_04"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37032","style":1,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"伊帕希娅","content":"秘金强度到极限了吗，不对……可恶，要没时间了……","voice":["vo_event_403703202_05"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37032","style":1,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"战场不会给人发呆的机会，下一道攻击呼啸而来——她没时间躲开了！","style":3,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"关键时刻，一道攻击从天而降，截断了使徒的袭击。","style":3,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"？？？","content":"交通封锁中，都给我让<size=44>·让</size><size=50>·道</size>啦！","voice":["vo_event_403703202_06"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37032","style":1,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"伊帕希娅震惊抬头，看到高处那个逆光的身影。","style":3,"background":2395,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"伊帕希娅","content":"——海拉？！","voice":["vo_event_403703202_07"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37032","style":1,"background":2395,"log_type":1}]}